# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT: LinguaFlow — Localization Project & Resource Coordination Platform

## 1. Project Overview

Build a complete, production-quality, full-stack web application named **LinguaFlow — Localization Project & Resource Coordination Platform**.

The platform must simulate the daily operations of a professional translation and localization services company. Its workflows must closely align with the responsibilities of an Associate Resource Coordinator at RWS, including translation project coordination, translator allocation, source-file preparation, deadline monitoring, linguistic quality checks, stakeholder communication, and operational reporting.

The application is an independent portfolio project, not an official RWS product.

**Primary objective:** Create a polished, functional, deployable business application that demonstrates practical coordination skills, attention to detail, organization, process compliance, resource management, communication, and timely delivery.

Do not build a generic admin dashboard, static prototype, or unnecessary AI chatbot. Build a genuine operational workflow in which actions persist to a database and update related dashboards, assignments, timelines, and reports.

